"Questors listen only to those known across Davrar for their deeds."
"Mortals doing deeds under Questor protection are seen as mere agents and dismissed."
"Years later the Heirs' first deed was conquering Esebus by killing Sussu's grid."
"Their second deed was clearing the Helmaris blight, just five of them, outside a solstice."
"Their third deed was winning a Polite War for the Ashen Accord, which won them a Conclave."
